      <p style="margin-bottom:20px;">The <strong>Old Decatur and Kingsway Historic District</strong> is Decatur at its most distinctive — Victorian-era homes, craftsman bungalows, and early-twentieth-century residences that carry the architectural character of the city's industrial prime. These homes present cleaning and restoration challenges that require genuine expertise: original hardwood floors under decades of finish layers, crawlspaces with moisture histories measured in generations, and plaster walls that respond to moisture differently than modern construction. We approach every historic Decatur job with the care these homes have earned.</p>
