      <p style="margin-bottom:20px;">The <strong>Beltline Road corridor and Southwest Decatur subdivisions</strong> represent Decatur's growth from the 1970s through the 1990s — a mix of brick ranch homes and two-story construction with carpet throughout the living areas and bedrooms. These are working families, many connected to Decatur's manufacturing sector, who need reliable carpet cleaning at fair prices with accurate quotes and no upsell surprises. This is the segment we've served most consistently and whose referrals drive the most new Decatur business we receive.</p>
      <p>The <strong>Country Club area and Westmeade</strong> represent Decatur's established professional neighborhoods — larger homes, hardwood and tile in the main living areas, carpet in the bedrooms and bonus rooms, and homeowners who've been using the same cleaning company for a decade because they found one that works and stopped looking. Many of these long-term Decatur clients have been with BamaClean since the 1990s.</p>
