    heading: "BamaClean vs. the Alternatives in Decatur",
    body: `
      <p style="margin-bottom:20px;">Decatur's cleaning and restoration market is served by national franchises operating out of Huntsville and Decatur-based offices, and by a rotating cast of local operators. The franchise options — Stanley Steemer, SERVPRO — bring brand recognition and standardized processes. The local operators bring variable quality and variable equipment levels. Here's the honest comparison.</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:20px;">National franchises price for volume and upsell margin. The quote you get on the phone is not the price on the invoice. Protection packages, per-stain charges, and add-ons are built into the franchise revenue model — not because the technician is dishonest, but because the franchise system is designed to maximize per-job revenue. BamaClean quotes by square footage before we start. That number is your invoice.</p>
